    }
  ],
  "uncertainty": "The abstract provides no details on actual energy use, licensing or consent, crowdworker compensation or conditions, API terms, safety measures, or downstream harms. Therefore, these are potential ethical concerns and risks rather than confirmed ethical violations.",
